# MDX

- Blank lines before/after JSX blocks inside markdown
- Avoid `<br />` inside markdown lists — use proper list structure
- Run `yarn lint:mdx` / `yarn format:mdx` when editing MDX heavily
- Keep accessibility: headings hierarchy, link text, image alt when embedding media
